<title>SWEDEN: Trelleborg rises with Boliden news due.</title>
<headline>Trelleborg rises with Boliden news due.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish mining group Trelleborg rose in early trade on Monday on speculation about a coming announcement by its Boliden unit due in a couple of hours.</p>
<p>At 0820 the share was trading 4.5 crowns higher at 113 crowns while the general market index was up 0.20 percent.</p>
<p>The share rose in January on rumours that Trelleborg would spin off its Boliden unit.</p>
<p>Trelleborg said earlier on Monday that Boliden would make some sort of an announcement to the market in a couple of hours.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
